00:00:54,269 --> 00:00:58,309
Oh, you... There is no one I adore more.

3
00:00:59,049 --> 00:01:06,529
You, who must have risked life and limb to be here with me forevermore.

4
00:01:07,449 --> 00:01:18,109
The last words I wrote before I was cast into this endless abyss by the immortals seeking to protect this world and all of its inhabitants...

5
00:01:19,349 --> 00:01:25,109
wrapped in darkness, alone, void of all emotion.

6
00:01:26,179 --> 00:01:35,349
I once more feel a presence, signaling my return. Love's fervent seal... a spark of light in this ocean.

7
00:01:36,569 --> 00:01:42,709
Now, there is but little left for you to do before I am free and we can be together.

8
00:01:43,519 --> 00:01:49,889
And those who trapped me within these pages shall rue locking away this beauty forever.

9
00:01:50,409 --> 00:01:52,889
Only your love can set me free.

10
00:01:53,429 --> 00:02:00,839
Go, recite the verse before you quickly... lest before me you bend and take a knee.

11
00:03:26,900 --> 00:03:33,100
Once in a faraway, faraway world was a collar that cooed like a snake

12
