I want someone, please, I need someone, please, oh, I listened close as it howled in ache

13
00:03:40,100 --> 00:03:45,300
Please don't be angry and please don't abandon me, don't leave me here on my own

14
00:03:45,800 --> 00:03:52,000
It wrapped itself tightly, daily and nightly, only with praise would it loosen its hold

15
00:03:52,100 --> 00:03:55,200
I'm pleased in the cup of my clothes

16
00:03:55,300 --> 00:03:58,700
There's no one left for me to surpass

17
