No one is no one is ever enough

26
00:05:17,102 --> 00:05:18,202
Won't lose to anyone always rank number one

27
00:05:20,102 --> 00:05:22,452
Aren't I a beautiful child

28
00:05:22,982 --> 00:05:26,332
I'm better than her I'm better than him

29
00:05:26,982 --> 00:05:31,542
Oh everyone come 'round and gawk at perfection

30
00:05:31,542 --> 00:05:34,342
meeting you right after school

31
00:05:34,342 --> 00:05:35,982
and finally confessing to you

32
00:05:36,382 --> 00:05:38,382
Ain't it too good to be true

33
00:05:38,882 --> 00:05:44,882
A girl like me in love with you who's miserable vulgar and crude

34
00:05:45,982 --> 00:05:47,982
Give me your love all of your love

35
00:05:47,982 --> 00:05:50,732
give me your love you can have everything

36
00:05:51,482 --> 00:05:54,882
If I have you I can have you

37
00:05:54,882 --> 00:05:57,582
Shoulder my load now yours to behold

38
00:05:57,882 --> 00:06:00,482
Still not enough you're not enough

39
00:06:00,682 --> 00:06:04,582
never enough still I won't lose in my heart

40
00:06:07,732 --> 00:06:10,732
Truly I'm so sorry give me your love all of your love

41
00:06:13,332 --> 00:06:16,532
give me your love all you can conjure up

42
00:06:16,732 --> 00:06:20,032
give me your love all of your love

43
00:06:20,032 --> 00:06:22,632
'til you go mad with ecstasy

44
00:06:23,182 --> 00:06:26,382
I know it hurts only gets worse

45
00:06:26,382 --> 00:06:32,382
God how it hurts soon you'll be craving more pain

46
00:06:32,382 --> 00:06:35,582
This is my happiness now

47
00:07:30,596 --> 00:07:33,008
Did you enjoy my lovely song?

48
00:07:33,616 --> 00:07:35,808
I hope you did.

49
00:07:36,096 --> 00:07:38,608
It was for you, after all.

50
00:07:38,836 --> 00:07:40,536
But...

51
00:07:40,696 --> 00:07:42,676
why are you not smiling?

52
00:07:43,116 --> 00:07:44,816
Are you not happy to see me?

53
00:07:47,086 --> 00:07:47,996
Well?

54
00:07:48,856 --> 00:07:49,636
Say something.

55
00:07:50,386 --> 00:07:50,656
Answer me.

56
00:07:51,546 --> 00:07:51,956
Who...

57
00:07:52,596 --> 00:07:53,156
who are you?

58
00:07:53,866 --> 00:07:54,256
What?

59
00:07:55,806 --> 00:07:56,386
You don't know who I am?

60
00:07:58,266 --> 00:07:58,876
But everyone knows.

61
00:08:00,426 --> 00:08:01,986
You are the one that released me, right?

62
00:08:03,796 --> 00:08:04,566
I'm...

63
00:08:04,566 --> 00:08:05,146
I'm sorry.

64
00:08:05,956 --> 00:08:06,516
You're sorry?

65
00:08:08,336 --> 00:08:09,136
For what?

66
00:08:09,916 --> 00:08:10,526
For releasing me?

67
00:08:11,616 --> 00:08:12,916
No, no, no. For upsetting you.

68
00:08:13,866 --> 00:08:15,006
If I said something wrong, I apologize.

69
00:08:16,756 --> 00:08:17,436
Apologize?

70
00:08:18,416 --> 00:08:22,706
You, who should be amongst my most dearest and beloved followers,

71
00:08:23,696 --> 00:08:26,406
who has freed me from that prison,

72
00:08:26,406 --> 00:08:28,796
who has shown me your love above all others...

73
00:08:30,236 --> 00:08:32,566
You then act like you don't even know who I am?

74
00:08:34,036 --> 00:08:36,216
Why would you toy with my emotions?

75
00:08:37,396 --> 00:08:38,996
I'm... I'm sorry, I'm not sure what you mean.

76
00:08:40,626 --> 00:08:41,956
You're not sure what I mean?

77
00:08:42,836 --> 00:08:44,296
Are you mocking me now?

78
00:08:45,366 --> 00:08:47,496
If you truly do not know who I am,

79
00:08:47,496 --> 00:08:49,646
then why is it that you set me free?

80
00:08:50,566 --> 00:08:54,216
If not from my love and if not by your love, then for what?

81
00:08:55,836 --> 00:08:57,016
Tell me the truth, and the whole truth, now.

82
00:08:59,646 --> 00:09:01,966
No more lies, or there will be consequences.

83
00:09:03,446 --> 00:09:04,896
I-I'm not lying.

84
00:09:05,716 --> 00:09:06,606
I swear to you,

85
00:09:06,926 --> 00:09:08,816
I have no idea how I released you.

86
00:09:09,586 --> 00:09:14,286
I just came to a temple to collect rare spices and memories from the many books stowed away here.

87
00:09:14,896 --> 00:09:17,106
By the gods, that's the whole truth!

88
00:09:17,996 --> 00:09:19,576
Extract memories from books?

89
00:09:21,666 --> 00:09:22,996
Are you telling me you're a witch?

90
00:09:25,086 --> 00:09:26,476
How dare you step foot here!

91
00:09:28,036 --> 00:09:32,746
Even knowing the long history between demons and witches, you still dare set foot here?

92
00:09:33,956 --> 00:09:37,186
I know how witches dare to try and bind my kind.

93
00:09:38,396 --> 00:09:41,096
Would you be foolish enough to dare attempt that on me?

94
00:09:42,136 --> 00:09:44,376
Yes... Okay.

95
00:09:44,376 --> 00:09:47,976
Yes, I'm a witch, but I've never... well, mostly never tried anything like that.

96
00:09:51,456 --> 00:09:52,636
I-I swear!

97
00:09:53,916 --> 00:09:57,526
And this time, I was not let on by my nature at all.

98
00:09:57,786 --> 00:10:00,426
No, this time, it was an angel that spoke to me of this place.

99
00:10:01,986 --> 00:10:04,386
An angel came to me in my dreams, and...

100
00:10:04,955 --> 00:10:08,855
Told me of an enchanted book that centuries of memory stood away here.

101
00:10:08,900 --> 00:10:13,640
Can you imagine the knowledge and stories hidden in centuries of memories?

102
00:10:13,640 --> 00:10:18,830
With a prize like that, I had to come find a book, no matter the danger.

103
00:10:19,000 --> 00:10:22,600
Little could I have known the true nature of the book, though.

104
00:10:22,600 --> 00:10:25,490
Enough! I've heard enough.

105
00:10:25,810 --> 00:10:30,440
I believe you are who you say you are: a witch.

106
00:10:30,870 --> 00:10:38,000
But I don't fully believe your childish story. No angel would ever lead a witch to such a dangerous book.

107
00:10:38,100 --> 00:10:43,900
And I can hardly believe it is just the book and not myself you are after.

108
00:10:44,070 --> 00:10:48,520
It... It's true. An angel came to me in my dreams...

109
00:10:48,520 --> 00:10:52,140
and told me to come here. I was drawn to that book,

110
00:10:52,140 --> 00:10:58,140
with all its power and stories. And well, I guess, you inside it.

111
00:10:58,700 --> 00:11:01,930
The powerful aura it gave off drew me right to it.

112
00:11:02,010 --> 00:11:09,040
How was I to know that the aura was thanks to a demon trapped within its pages?

113
00:11:09,040 --> 00:11:15,740
Though, now that I recount my story, it does seem it really was me who released you.

114
00:11:15,880 --> 00:11:22,820
Speaking of coming and going, now that you are free, I think it is time I take my leave of this place.

115
00:11:23,180 --> 00:11:27,100
I'm glad I was able to help free you from... from once again.

116
00:11:27,100 --> 00:11:29,800
I didn't say you could leave.

117
00:11:32,180 --> 00:11:38,960
You may leave when I say you can leave, and stop your nervous fidgeting.

118
00:11:38,960 --> 00:11:45,000
I know, fool. You think I didn't see you reaching for your book of magic?

119
00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:53,640
You, a witch, should know better than anyone that no amount of magic is powerful enough to destroy a demon of my power.

120
00:11:53,950 --> 00:12:01,300
However, you can take some solace in the fact that if I had wanted you dead, you'd already be so.

121
00:12:01,400 --> 00:12:06,890
The only reason you're still alive is because you helped free me.

122
00:12:07,150 --> 00:12:15,190
Alas, I cannot allow a witch who so obviously came with the intent to bind me to her will leave here freely.

123
00:12:15,190 --> 00:12:19,650
Your story did little to convince me your aims were otherwise.

124
00:12:19,650 --> 00:12:25,670
So, I will give you an ultimatum: you serve me here in my hollow temple,

125
00:12:25,870 --> 00:12:31,300
love me, adore me, worship me.

126
00:12:31,610 --> 00:12:37,170
Every living day, give me all the love you have.

127
00:12:37,410 --> 00:12:42,130
Or I can take your soul right now. Your choice.

128
00:12:42,740 --> 00:12:46,590
Kiarah... I need you.

129
00:13:03,104 --> 00:13:07,764
Lost in the rain with no umbrella

130
00:13:07,764 --> 00:13:10,884
Nights nest out your eyes

131
00:13:10,884 --> 00:13:13,614
Can't seem to find your way back home

132
00:13:13,614 --> 00:13:17,964
Come in and be my guest

133
00:13:18,194 --> 00:13:25,674
Such a lovely smile spread across your face, but it's simply forgery

134
00:13:25,674 --> 00:13:32,554
If you need to hide from the world outside, why not try to be my guest

135
00:13:32,924 --> 00:13:41,324
Waiting all day long, but your friends don't come and you're left there all alone

136
00:13:41,324 --> 00:13:47,264
Still you can't jump off from the high rooftop, so come on and be my guest

137
00:13:47,764 --> 00:13:51,374
Like a cat the way I step and step and step

138
00:13:51,374 --> 00:13:54,804
Be careful as my feet go tap and tap and tap

139
00:13:54,804 --> 00:13:58,064
We'll follow nicely with a snap and snap and snap

140
00:13:58,064 --> 00:14:02,274
So lovely you'll be mesmerized by me

141
00:14:05,414 --> 00:14:10,414
My institution's peaceful as can be, despite the way that it seems, both our quotes and our supports will be concise, clearly, clean

142
00:14:10,774 --> 00:14:14,674
Since we're only starting out, there's some improbabilities

143
00:14:14,674 --> 00:14:17,544
But just listen up tonight, you'll have to stay up peacefully

144
00:14:18,074 --> 00:14:20,304
Friends? They don't like you

145
00:14:20,304 --> 00:14:24,194
When you know it's true, still you're right there back and call

146
00:14:24,744 --> 00:14:31,544
Since you're desperately given easily, come inside and be my guest

147
00:14:31,904 --> 00:14:34,984
You're the last to choose, but your luck's confused

148
00:14:34,984 --> 00:14:39,164
Seems that someone took your share

149
00:14:39,164 --> 00:14:46,044
If you won't accuse 'cause you don't have proof, take your chance then be my guest

150
00:14:50,624 --> 00:14:54,914
On the way back home, there's a sweet aroma

151
00:14:54,914 --> 00:14:57,874
That tempts you off your path

152
00:14:57,874 --> 00:15:01,705
I can't help but laugh 'cause I know in fact

153
00:15:01,785 --> 00:15:03,055
Soon you're bound to be my guest.

154
00:15:30,545 --> 00:15:30,985
Yo!

155
00:15:31,685 --> 00:15:33,675
Demon! How dare you kill an innocent?

156
00:15:36,315 --> 00:15:39,085
Excuse me! I've done no such thing.

157
00:15:39,955 --> 00:15:42,125
Innocent?

158
00:15:43,045 --> 00:15:47,095
I would hardly call a witch who lives for power and binds my kind for her own purposes innocent.

159
00:15:48,125 --> 00:15:51,145
Very ideas laughable.

160
00:15:56,045 --> 00:15:59,605
Leave, I have no quarrel with you, so go now in peace before I change my mind.

161
00:16:03,105 --> 00:16:06,865
A small token for your past bravery and trials.

162
00:16:07,605 --> 00:16:12,275
How gracious, don't think I can't see straight through your ploy still.

163
00:16:12,935 --> 00:16:17,235
You will not escape justice, not this time.

164
00:16:17,385 --> 00:16:21,845
You have brought this fight on yourself for your actions, demon.

165
00:16:22,055 --> 00:16:25,655
We have brought all of this on yourself.

166
00:16:25,785 --> 00:16:26,155
For what?

167
00:16:26,665 --> 00:16:28,245
For killing a mere witch?

168
00:16:28,845 --> 00:16:32,955
She was not just a witch, she was my friend and a kindhearted person.

169
00:16:35,955 --> 00:16:38,275
And you killed her in cold blood.

170
00:16:39,195 --> 00:16:39,915
Oh, the legendary Phoenix, the mighty fiery Kiara, friends with a witch?

171
00:16:49,085 --> 00:16:51,195
It's almost funny, did you not realize?

172
00:16:53,385 --> 00:16:57,095
It was your witch friend who freed me.

173
00:16:57,235 --> 00:16:57,635
Liar!

174
00:16:58,465 --> 00:17:01,535
She would never do such a ghastly thing.

175
00:17:02,025 --> 00:17:06,615
I trust she would stay away from the dark magics and demonic rituals.

176
00:17:06,805 --> 00:17:11,005
To suggest otherwise is just another one of your dark lies.

177
00:17:11,855 --> 00:17:13,535
She didn't deserve to die.

178
00:17:14,485 --> 00:17:22,615
Poor Phoenix, still so trusting of those around you and unable to see through their deceptions.

179
00:17:23,275 --> 00:17:26,475
Your kind spirit constantly deceives you.

180
00:17:26,805 --> 00:17:29,125
That witch was never your friend.

181
00:17:30,615 --> 00:17:36,605
We all know they cannot be trusted, even after all these years you still have not changed, still believing in lies and still so easily misled.

182
00:17:42,835 --> 00:17:45,605
Still such a fool.

183
00:17:45,905 --> 00:17:48,125
It is you who is the fool, demon!

184
00:17:49,085 --> 00:17:54,025
Your lust for love and attention continues to lead you down the path of death and destruction.

185
00:17:55,085 --> 00:17:59,965
And you don't even see that you're the one destroying your own happiness.

186
00:18:01,095 --> 00:18:06,615
The gods are right to confine you there, you who are still shackled by your lust for love,

187
00:18:08,335 --> 00:18:13,535
your desire for attention, your desire to be worshipped.

188
00:18:13,885 --> 00:18:16,605
I am the demon of sound!

189
00:18:17,245 --> 00:18:20,125
How dare you speak to me in such a manner!

190
00:18:21,115 --> 00:18:28,495
It is but right that all should worship me on their knees, their love for none but myself.

191
00:18:29,455 --> 00:18:38,275
Leave! I have heard enough of your falsities, this is your last warning. Go now, or you'll be left to rot here forever.

192
00:18:39,955 --> 00:18:42,125
I am not afraid of you, and I will heed no such warning.

193
00:18:45,215 --> 00:18:48,865
Listen, and listen well, demon,

194
00:18:49,155 --> 00:18:52,515
I will not allow you to claim any more victims.

195
00:18:52,805 --> 00:18:57,965
To be banished in the void was not sufficient enough punishment for you.

196
00:18:59,405 --> 00:19:01,085
No.

197
00:19:01,605 --> 00:19:06,615
Now I will finish what the gods should have.

198
00:19:12,205 --> 00:19:14,905
とべ、起こせ！ 願う は 事故
Fly, get moving! All I want is trouble.

199
00:19:14,905 --> 00:19:16,855
一世 一代 さあ 何 賭す？ 自問 自答
Once in a lifetime, what do you bet on? Self-analysis!

200
00:19:16,855 --> 00:19:18,595
勝つ か 負ける か ドロー なんて ない わ
It's about win or lose, there can't be a draw.

201
00:19:18,595 --> 00:19:19,355
ah, ah, ah, hey 幕開ける わ
Ah, ah, ah, hey, let's open the curtains!

202
00:19:19,355 --> 00:19:21,845
カッチング して ラッキー マネー どっち も むりー cigar, cigar
Catch it, lucky money, seems impossible... (Cigar, cigar!)

203
00:19:21,845 --> 00:19:23,765
引ける か 否 か 自分 次第 だ な
You gonna pull out or no? It all depends on me, huh?

204
00:19:23,765 --> 00:19:26,105
余裕 で！ 振り切り 全 bet だぜ い イェイ イェイ イェイ イェイ ☆！
Piece of cake! I'll bet it all and give it all I got! Yay, yay, yay, yay, ☆!

205
00:19:26,105 --> 00:19:29,205
そこ どけ ！ そう この エース かっ さらう の は アタシ だ
Out of my way! Yeah, I'll be the one to snatch this ace.

206
00:19:29,205 --> 00:19:31,325
stay もういい 勝た た なら 平常心
Stay, I've had enough! If I win, my mind will be at ease.

207
00:19:31,325 --> 00:19:33,655
ね プレイボーイ 行け don't get in my way じゃあね 黙っ て
Hey, playboy, go ahead, don't get in my way, see ya, just shut up.

208
