00:21:42,145 --> 00:21:43,965
I'm so sorry, Iris.

256
00:21:45,645 --> 00:21:46,825
It has been so long.

257
00:21:47,505 --> 00:21:48,705
Nerissa...

258
00:21:48,705 --> 00:21:53,245
I'm so, so sorry this happened to you. It was not my intention.

259
00:21:54,425 --> 00:21:55,645
What do you mean?

260
00:21:55,925 --> 00:21:57,605
What was not your intention?

261
00:21:58,605 --> 00:22:02,225
This... you being... then... the witch and...

262
00:22:02,225 --> 00:22:03,965
Kiara too.

263
00:22:04,485 --> 00:22:05,365
What?

264
00:22:05,665 --> 00:22:08,865
Are you saying you sent the Phoenix here to slay me?

265
00:22:09,525 --> 00:22:10,465
No, I didn't!

266
00:22:10,705 --> 00:22:13,145
Well, yes, but it was not my intention!

267
00:22:13,685 --> 00:22:16,465
Iris, what are you trying to tell me?

268
00:22:17,125 --> 00:22:19,285
That you tried to kill me?

269
00:22:19,685 --> 00:22:23,205
You were supposed to be my friend! We've been friends since the beginning!

270
00:22:23,585 --> 00:22:26,885
Yes, of... yes! You sent Kiara to kill me?

271
00:22:27,125 --> 00:22:27,805
No! No!

272
00:22:28,025 --> 00:22:28,765
Then what?

273
00:22:30,145 --> 00:22:35,345
Be clear. How is this how you greet your beloved friend after so long?

274
00:22:36,405 --> 00:22:39,485
No, I... I would never send someone to kill you.

275
00:22:39,805 --> 00:22:45,705
But yes, I'm still your loyal friend. I always have been, and always will be.

276
00:22:46,745 --> 00:22:51,945
I... I tried to free you, and I did. I sent the witch. You're here to free you, and she did.
"I... I tried to free you, and I did. I sent the witch here to free you, and she did."

277
00:22:52,625 --> 00:23:00,345
But I didn't know she was friends with Kiara, and when someone here threatened... I thought she would come alone.

278
00:23:00,345 --> 00:23:01,665
This was not supposed to happen.

279
00:23:01,805 --> 00:23:02,805
It was not my intention.

280
00:23:03,165 --> 00:23:07,805
You sent... a witch to free me? Why would you send one who binds my kind for power?

281
00:23:11,765 --> 00:23:15,885
Of all those in the world, a witch?

282
00:23:16,205 --> 00:23:22,625
Why not send one of my most beloved followers? Only they are said to be able to free me.

283
00:23:23,125 --> 00:23:24,505
Explain yourself.

284
00:23:24,805 --> 00:23:26,105
What's going on?

285
00:23:27,725 --> 00:23:30,145
I'm... I'm sorry. I have a lot to explain,

286
00:23:30,145 --> 00:23:32,105
but we don't have time now.

287
00:23:32,305 --> 00:23:34,685
We need to go. Now.

288
00:23:35,245 --> 00:23:36,665
Death is coming for you.

289
00:23:37,045 --> 00:23:37,705
What?

290
00:23:37,925 --> 00:23:39,485
Please, come with me.

291
00:23:39,745 --> 00:23:42,925
I know a way in which we can hide from death.

292
00:23:42,925 --> 00:23:45,725
But we have to leave now before it's too late.

293
00:23:45,885 --> 00:23:49,865
I'm not going anywhere with you until you explain to me what is going on.

294
00:23:51,665 --> 00:23:54,945
Now! Why would you send a witch to free me, Iris?

295
00:23:56,365 --> 00:23:57,885
Celia, I had no choice.

296
00:23:58,285 --> 00:23:59,685
You had no choice.

297
00:24:00,225 --> 00:24:03,805
You could have sent one of my followers instead.

298
00:24:04,105 --> 00:24:07,805
You don't have any more followers! They're all dead!

299
00:24:07,805 --> 00:24:09,445
They all died long ago.

300
00:24:10,305 --> 00:24:10,925
What?

301
00:24:12,645 --> 00:24:14,525
No, that... that can't be.

302
00:24:16,545 --> 00:24:17,725
Has it been that long?

303
00:24:19,765 --> 00:24:22,925
It's been over a thousand years since you've been locked away.

304
00:24:23,025 --> 00:24:25,825
and your followers, they're all gone now.

305
00:24:26,405 --> 00:24:30,025
It's been many long years since your name was whispered in these lands.

306
00:24:30,665 --> 00:24:36,905
You mean... they... no longer... love me?

307
00:24:38,565 --> 00:24:41,565
I... I'm sorry. I tried to free you as fast as I could.

308
00:24:41,565 --> 00:24:42,885
I really did.

309
00:24:43,325 --> 00:24:46,805
But it took a long time to work out how to free you and
"But it took a long time to work out how to free you,"

310
00:24:46,805 --> 00:24:49,865
there was so much going on,
"and there was so much going on."

311
00:24:50,045 --> 00:24:53,725
and the gods weren't about to look kindly on any trying to undo their work either.
"And the gods weren't about to look kindly on anyone trying to undo their work either."

312
00:24:54,465 --> 00:24:58,225
I'm sorry. I don't have time to explain everything right now.

313
00:24:59,625 --> 00:25:02,225
I understand. But, Iris...

314
00:25:02,818 --> 00:25:04,098
Tell me...

315
00:25:04,878 --> 00:25:06,318
Do you still love me?

316
00:25:07,928 --> 00:25:08,518
What?

317
00:25:08,958 --> 00:25:09,908
Yes, of course.

318
00:25:10,228 --> 00:25:12,328
Then why do you lie to me?

319
00:25:12,808 --> 00:25:15,128
I... I'm not lying, Nerissa!

320
00:25:15,228 --> 00:25:16,118
Enough!

321
00:25:16,558 --> 00:25:19,178
You of all people should understand

322
00:25:19,178 --> 00:25:24,338
that a witch wouldn't be able to resist the power in my book and attempt to bind me.

323
00:25:24,798 --> 00:25:33,728
And you can hardly expect me to believe that you, one of both planes, didn't know of the witch's connection to such a famed warrior.

324
00:25:34,028 --> 00:25:40,198
This wasn't an attempt to free me... This...

325
00:25:40,198 --> 00:25:41,888
this was an attempt to kill me!

326
00:25:42,298 --> 00:25:46,458
To be free of me, to do what the gods couldn't! Get back!

327
00:25:46,978 --> 00:25:50,158
Nerissa, that's not true! You don't understand!

328
00:25:51,108 --> 00:25:54,458
Please give me some time to explain. But...

329
00:25:54,458 --> 00:25:57,268
but not here! Death is coming for you, we have to go!

330
00:25:57,688 --> 00:25:59,618
I'm not going anywhere with you!

331
00:26:03,038 --> 00:26:07,058
Nerissa, surely by now Kiara's soul has arrived before Death! And what if Death finds out that you're free again?

332
00:26:07,308 --> 00:26:10,518
We don't have much time! We have to go, now!

333
00:26:11,328 --> 00:26:12,078
Please, Nerissa!

334
00:26:12,458 --> 00:26:15,328
No... I don't believe you.

335
00:26:16,008 --> 00:26:22,268
You've broken my spirit. To learn that my followers no longer love me was one thing...

336
00:26:22,638 --> 00:26:30,308
...but to discover that my closest and most loyal friend has betrayed me... tried to kill me...

337
00:26:30,708 --> 00:26:33,708
...and no longer loves me too.

338
00:26:34,688 --> 00:26:41,028
If you no longer wish to give me your love, then I will take it.

339
00:27:00,173 --> 00:27:06,973
遠ざかりはじめた その背中はもう振り戻れない
The back that began to fade away can no longer look back

340
00:27:06,973 --> 00:27:09,773
長い夜が明けても
Even if the long night breaks,

341
00:27:09,773 --> 00:27:14,523
過ちと罪は 今もずっと消えずに
the mistakes and sins still do not disappear

342
00:27:14,523 --> 00:27:19,573
落ちる夕陽 闇が忍び寄り 黒く染まっていく純粋
The setting sun, darkness creeps closer, dyeing the purity black

343
00:27:19,573 --> 00:27:22,223
想うほどに どうして傷で試した？
The more I think about it, why did I test you with wounds?

344
00:27:22,223 --> 00:27:26,673
欲しかったのは唯一つ その笑顔なのに
All I wanted was that one smile

345
00:27:26,673 --> 00:27:31,673
何度間違い続けた日々を 解いて結び直すように
As if untying and re-tying the days I kept making mistakes in

346
00:27:31,673 --> 00:27:37,223
迷っても会いに行くよ 悲しい涙は拭いて
Even if I get lost, I will go to see you, wiping away your sad tears

347
00:27:37,223 --> 00:27:41,773
いつの間にか忘れていた その優しい声を探して
Searching for that gentle voice I had forgotten before I knew it

348
00:27:41,773 --> 00:27:45,273
また手を取り合えたなら 君ともう一度約束を交わそう
If we can hold hands once again, let's make a promise with you once more

349
00:27:45,273 --> 00:27:48,073
途切れそうな可能性 見失わないように追いかけて
Chasing the fading possibility so as not to lose sight of it

350
00:27:48,073 --> 00:27:52,573
手に入れたものなら 理想とは違う どこか欠けた愛情
As for what I got, it's love different from ideal, lacking somewhere

351
00:27:52,573 --> 00:27:58,323
怒り嘆き 歪んだまま ぶつけ合う逆さまの言葉
Anger, grief, distorted, hitting each other with upside-down words

352
00:27:58,323 --> 00:28:01,973
想うほどに どうして許せなかった？
The more I think about it, why couldn't I forgive?

353
00:28:01,973 --> 00:28:06,723
守りたかった笑顔を 気づけば壊して
The smile I wanted to protect, before I knew it, I broke it

354
00:28:10,773 --> 00:28:14,573
たとえすれ違い 離れていても 君を信じられたなら
Even if we pass each other and are apart, if I could believe in you

355
00:28:14,573 --> 00:28:20,273
また逢える日が来たから 二人懐かしい顔で
Since the day we can meet again has come, with nostalgic faces for both of us

356
00:28:20,273 --> 00:28:25,273
何気なく過ごしていた あの時を思い返すような
Like recalling that time we spent so casually

357
00:28:25,273 --> 00:28:30,673
ありのまま通じ合えていた まるで運命のように
Able to communicate just as we are, as if it were destiny

358
00:28:30,673 --> 00:28:36,973
失くしたものが もう戻らないこと わかっていても 願いをかけること 止められはしない
Even knowing that what has been lost will never return, I cannot stop making a wish

359
00:28:36,973 --> 00:28:42,573
「いつか…」どれほど大切だった人だったのか 胸が苦しむ度に知った
"Someday..." I learned every time my chest ached how precious a person you were

360
00:28:42,573 --> 00:28:46,473
ともに過ごした日を 笑い合った日々にを
The days we spent together, the days we laughed together

361
00:28:46,473 --> 00:28:50,773
何度間違い続けた日々を 解いて結び直すように
As if untying and re-tying the days I kept making mistakes in

362
00:28:50,773 --> 00:28:55,273
迷っても会いに行くよ 悲しい涙は拭いて
Even if I get lost, I will go to see you, wiping away your sad tears

363
00:28:55,273 --> 00:28:59,773
いつの間にか忘れていた その優しい声を探して
Searching for that gentle voice I had forgotten before I knew it

364
00:28:59,773 --> 00:29:04,773
また手を取り合えたなら 君ともう一度約束を交わそう きっと…
If we can hold hands once again, let's make a promise with you once more, surely...

365
00:29:28,773 --> 00:29:33,273
なくしたものが もう戻らないこと
That what has been lost will never return

366
00:29:33,273 --> 00:29:39,773
わかっていても 願いをかけること 止められはしない
Even knowing it, I cannot stop making a wish

367
00:29:39,773 --> 00:29:46,773
「いつか…」どれほど大切だった人だったのか 胸が苦しむ度に知った
"Someday..." I learned every time my chest ached how precious you were

368
00:29:46,773 --> 00:29:54,773
ともに過ごした日を 笑い合った日々に…
The days we spent together, the days we laughed together...

369
00:30:02,530 --> 00:30:07,170
笑い合った日々を
The days when we laughed together

370
00:30:11,090 --> 00:30:14,490
何度間違い続けた日々を
The days of endless mistakes

371
00:30:44,542 --> 00:30:50,382
迷っても会いに行くよ
Even if I get lost, I'll go meet you

372
00:31:18,738 --> 00:31:19,698
Kiara... Dead?

373
00:31:22,638 --> 00:31:24,898
Never thought I'd see the day.

374
00:31:25,138 --> 00:31:27,718
But tell me, what laid you low?

375
00:31:27,958 --> 00:31:30,558
I must know, is there a foe that could bring this about,

376
00:31:30,558 --> 00:31:36,498
and even fewer who would give you reason to voyage on through my blackened halls and not return to the world of the living as a hatchling?

377
00:31:36,778 --> 00:31:39,398
Must be urgent, whatever it is.

378
00:31:40,318 --> 00:31:44,698
Forgive me, but I felt this was something you needed to hear urgently.

379
00:31:45,378 --> 00:31:50,058
I was slain by one with whom you are quite familiar,

380
00:31:50,298 --> 00:31:58,778
a tyrant of darkness, one out to bring all the world under her domain, to worship her for all eternity.

381
00:31:59,498 --> 00:32:01,058
It can't be.

382
00:32:01,298 --> 00:32:09,678
I'm afraid the demon of sound has been freed from the void again and is in the world once more; her long confinement has ended,

383
00:32:09,678 --> 00:32:14,798
and she is the same as she has ever been, quick to anger, blinded by her lust for adoration.

384
00:32:15,158 --> 00:32:20,598
And this time, I was the second victim of her lust for love and blood.

385
00:32:25,538 --> 00:32:28,938
You? Murdered by that love-obsessed demon?

386
00:32:29,178 --> 00:32:34,598
Yes. And her first victim was a good friend of mine, too.

387
00:32:35,598 --> 00:32:40,678
Forgive me, Lord Death, but this injustice cannot stand;

388
00:32:40,678 --> 00:32:44,878
unfortunately, her power is already beyond my ability to stop.

389
00:32:45,458 --> 00:32:51,278
Please, you must do something to stop that monster;

390
00:32:51,278 --> 00:32:57,418
she will surely only take more lives and plunge the world into further chaos.

391
00:32:58,278 --> 00:33:03,678
Come on, quick, ascend to the world of the living with your great scythe in hand

392
00:33:03,678 --> 00:33:08,638
and reap the life of the demon of sound before she can claim another victim.

393
00:33:09,258 --> 00:33:13,018
Avenge my life and the life of my friend, I beg you.

394
00:33:13,958 --> 00:33:19,678
That demon cannot be left to ravage the world once more; I warned the other gods before, but here we are;

395
00:33:19,678 --> 00:33:24,938
it is time I take this into my own hand and do what I should have done long ago.

396
00:33:39,398 --> 00:33:42,398
Your demonic side was always to be the death of you, IRyS.

397
00:33:42,858 --> 00:33:45,078
Don't you dare speak her name.

398
00:33:45,318 --> 00:33:45,998
Silence.

399
00:33:46,538 --> 00:33:49,978
Your bloodlust and desire for adoration has clouded your judgment

400
00:33:49,978 --> 00:33:52,798
to the point where you can't even tell friend from foe anymore.

401
00:33:53,498 --> 00:33:57,678
You're the one who brought bloody doom upon your own beloved friend, and yourself;

402
00:33:57,678 --> 00:34:01,158
your fear of losing your hold over things brings about the very result you so fear.

403
00:34:05,138 --> 00:34:08,178
How dare you continue on with your excuses,

404
00:34:08,178 --> 00:34:11,078
blame who you will for your own misdoing if you wish;

405
00:34:11,318 --> 00:34:13,978
in the end, you have only yourself to blame

406
00:34:13,978 --> 00:34:16,718
for the situation you find yourself in.

407
00:34:17,318 --> 00:34:22,638
A lust for love so strong that those you love turn away,

408
00:34:23,018 --> 00:34:28,938
a desire for power so overwhelming, those you have power over turn on you.

409
00:34:31,158 --> 00:34:36,078
In anger so deep that you destroy all who might have helped save you,

410
00:34:36,758 --> 00:34:40,098
your fate has been sealed by your own hand.

